00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:36.573
(laughing)

00:03:36.573 --> 00:03:37.620
- I know!

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:39.750
- I really believe that if you,

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.710
'cause I get stopped on
the street all the time

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:43.821
