up to me and they're like,

00:03:43.821 --> 00:03:45.780
"I told him who you are."

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:47.911
And I'm like, I am a 38 year old man.

00:03:47.911 --> 00:03:49.910
I don't know what you told him

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:52.113
but they're like, "Do the Olaf thing."

00:03:52.113 --> 00:03:55.440
You can really only do it
for kids who are over ten.

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:56.550
If you're Mickey Mouse,

00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:58.360
if you're the voice of Mickey Mouse,

00:03:58.360 --> 00:03:59.830
and you've got like a thick beard,

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:01.930
