like, give me a second,

00:04:07.225 --> 00:04:09.048
hi, how are ya kids?

00:04:09.048 --> 00:04:11.805
- Oh my God, that was so good!

00:04:11.805 --> 00:04:13.111
- Yeah.

00:04:13.111 --> 00:04:14.079
Hey, what are you up to?

00:04:14.079 --> 00:04:16.953
I gotta get back, my wife is
waiting for me in the car.

00:04:16.953 --> 00:04:17.860
(laughing)

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:18.863
Like, no.

00:04:18.863 --> 00:04:20.906
Don't do this to your children.

00:04:20.906 --> 00:04:22.028
