00:04:26.066 --> 00:04:27.323
(laughing)

00:04:27.323 --> 00:04:28.413
- I love you!

00:04:28.413 --> 00:04:29.960
- They hate it because
the Olaf voice is the,

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:31.108
this is the voice.

00:04:31.108 --> 00:04:36.082
Right, so, I tried for a while
reading them "Frozen" books

00:04:36.082 --> 00:04:37.896
