00:05:08.983 --> 00:05:11.003
"All right, we're just
gonna go play back there."

00:05:11.003 --> 00:05:12.890
I'm like, I'm, wait.

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:14.630
This was for bonding.

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:16.600
- This was for bonding!

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:17.706
Where are you?

00:05:17.706 --> 00:05:19.517
- I'm not getting paid for this.

00:05:19.517 --> 00:05:20.492
(laughing)

00:05:20.492 --> 00:05:22.390
- But that's gotta be amazing for them.

00:05:22.390 --> 00:05:23.223
That would be amazing.

00:05:23.223 --> 00:05:24.450
- It would, you would think.

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:25.840
- No, I mean the other kids as well.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.071
To have you come and do
that, that's amazing.

00:05:27.071 --> 00:05:28.150
- Oh, it's great.

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:29.999
And they pay me under the
table, so it makes it all right.

00:05:29.999 --> 00:05:32.473
Those kids pay me under the table.

00:05:32.473 --> 00:05:33.310
(laughing)

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:34.271
- In like Skittles.

00:05:34.271 --> 00:05:35.441
- No, hard cash.

00:05:35.441 --> 00:05:36.274
- Yeah, hard cash.

00:05:36.274 --> 00:05:37.107
- Hard cash.

00:05:37.107 --> 00:05:38.890
- And, I'll take your lunch money.

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:39.901
- And I'll take your lunch money.

00:05:39.901 --> 00:05:41.060
(laughing)

