How many of you have children?

00:05:52.361 --> 00:05:53.194
Okay, wow.

00:05:53.194 --> 00:05:54.264
Okay.

00:05:54.264 --> 00:05:56.070
The rest of you, get goin'.

00:05:56.070 --> 00:05:56.903
Whenever you're ready.

00:05:56.903 --> 00:05:57.890
(laughing)

00:05:57.890 --> 00:05:58.880
- Or enjoy your freedom.

00:05:58.880 --> 00:05:59.713
- Or enjoy your freedom.

00:05:59.713 --> 00:06:00.800
(laughing)

